B.CA=new A.b6("Build Readiness Gates",B.Pz,B.o)
B.OD=s(["Pricing, billing, usage, subscription, and revenue wording must remain evidence-based and approval-gated.","This screen does not create invoices, subscriptions, account charges, customer quotes, or public pricing claims.","Commercial status must remain aligned with tenant access boundaries and RayAI web portal readiness."],t.s)
